    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car Grind is a kinetic game where you use combos of flips, grinds, and wheelies to power your car while you explore each arena. Your car is powered by combos, doing more tricks allows you to extend your reach from each recharge station.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/0213002102fae8a474f1b11fe0b5aef5.poster.avif?t=1742525251\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/0213002102fae8a474f1b11fe0b5aef5.webm?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/0213002102fae8a474f1b11fe0b5aef5.mp4?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump on rails and grind your car. Keep the balance right or slide off the edge and crash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jump &amp; Flip</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/1faca0385818572e18d231d4c785d11e.poster.avif?t=1742525251\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/1faca0385818572e18d231d4c785d11e.webm?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/1faca0385818572e18d231d4c785d11e.mp4?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your car in acrobatic flips! Don't forget to keep the car upright when you land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ice Drive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/9e65db9a9e3aa2f5626efefbada7e86e.poster.avif?t=1742525251\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/9e65db9a9e3aa2f5626efefbada7e86e.webm?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/9e65db9a9e3aa2f5626efefbada7e86e.mp4?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ice drive ability to continue your combos between two vertical ramps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bicycles &amp; Wheelies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/430ec65beda2cb79098773b09901ed52.poster.avif?t=1742525251\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/430ec65beda2cb79098773b09901ed52.webm?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/430ec65beda2cb79098773b09901ed52.mp4?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your car to follow dangerous paths to secret areas.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car Grind is a kinetic game where you use combos of flips, grinds, and wheelies to power your car while you explore each arena. Your car is powered by combos, doing more tricks allows you to extend your reach from each recharge station.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/0213002102fae8a474f1b11fe0b5aef5.poster.avif?t=1742525251\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/0213002102fae8a474f1b11fe0b5aef5.webm?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/0213002102fae8a474f1b11fe0b5aef5.mp4?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump on rails and grind your car. Keep the balance right or slide off the edge and crash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jump &amp; Flip</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/1faca0385818572e18d231d4c785d11e.poster.avif?t=1742525251\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/1faca0385818572e18d231d4c785d11e.webm?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/1faca0385818572e18d231d4c785d11e.mp4?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your car in acrobatic flips! Don't forget to keep the car upright when you land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ice Drive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/9e65db9a9e3aa2f5626efefbada7e86e.poster.avif?t=1742525251\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/9e65db9a9e3aa2f5626efefbada7e86e.webm?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/9e65db9a9e3aa2f5626efefbada7e86e.mp4?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ice drive ability to continue your combos between two vertical ramps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bicycles &amp; Wheelies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/430ec65beda2cb79098773b09901ed52.poster.avif?t=1742525251\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/430ec65beda2cb79098773b09901ed52.webm?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425280/extras/430ec65beda2cb79098773b09901ed52.mp4?t=1742525251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your car to follow dangerous paths to secret areas.</p>",
    "short_description": "Start up Car Grind to jump your car in acrobatic flips, drift and slide to chain combos, and GRIND! GRIND! GRIND! Nail tricks while you transfer around bowls, banks, and vertical ramps. Balance precise wheelies and grinds and never stop!",
